## Configure inspector nib -- derived from a stock OPENSTEP resource

`OSRDNDisplay/English.lproj/DisplayInspector.nib` is built by
`tools/r3/build-inspector-nib.py` from Configure.app's own display-inspector
nib (`/NextAdmin/Configure.app/English.lproj/DisplayInspector.nib`) rather
than authored from nothing: its File's Owner class is renamed and one radio
matrix and two labels are grafted in.  Its `data.dependency` is the stock
file unchanged, and its `data.classes` is the stock file with this project's
class appended.  The grafted controls are taken from nib templates decoded
from stock inspectors (kept in the sibling `openstep-spacesaver2ps2`
project).  It is stated here so the derivation is on the record rather than
implied by silence.  No Configure.app code is copied into this project; the
nib is a resource, and only the resource is derived.  The stock nib itself is
not committed.

